nificantly negative for EM and fact). So base-model geometry can predict where the fine-tune's write lands in activation space, while its translation into observed leakage stays partial — consistent with distance being an unreliable *behavioral* predictor here. This is a single-rig, in-distribution, forward-pass preview (MODERATE on the activation-space mechanism, LOW on the behavioral translation); the dose-controlled fleet retrain (#660) is the clean test.
